<title>USA: Teradyne Q4 net shr $0.03 vs $0.56.</title>
<headline>Teradyne Q4 net shr $0.03 vs $0.56.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>	Quarter Ended December 31,	    1996	  1995</p>
<p> Sales					    $241.3	$351.4</p>
<p> Net income					  2.9	  47.8</p>
<p>Earnings per share:</p>
<p>  Before nonrecurring charges		 0.12	  0.63</p>
<p>  After nonrecurring charges		  0.03	  0.56</p>
<p>Weighted average number or</p>
<p>  shares and equivalents		    85,321	85,338</p>
<p>	  Year Ended December 31		1996	  1995</p>
<p> Sales					  $1,171.6    $1,191.0</p>
<p> Net income					 93.6	 159.3</p>
<p>Earnings per share:</p>
<p>  Before nonrecurring charges		 1.48	  1.96</p>
<p>  After nonrecurring charges		  1.10	  1.89</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>  shares and equivalents:		   85,060	84,253</p>
<p>NOTE: Income for the quarter, excluding a charge of $10.8 million for severance payments and enhanced pension and medical benefits associated with an early retirement program, was $10.2 million or $0.12 per share.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk))</p>
